KiteOS does not modify the dimOS source tree. It is installed into the
virtualenv of a separate, pinned dimOS checkout (installed as kiteos-runtime).
deploy/runtime/kiteos-runtime.bundle is a git bundle of dimOS source commits and is distributed under the dimOS
license (Apache-2.0).

Portions of KiteOS are copied or adapted from dimOS. Each such source file keeps
its original Apache-2.0 copyright header and carries the additional line

    # Modified by Kite ML for KiteOS.

These include:
  - src/kiteos/blueprints/: adapted from the dimOS dual OpenYAM teleop and
    learning-collection blueprints, and (openarm.py) the dimOS OpenArm WebXR
    teleop blueprint.
  - src/kiteos/rollout/runtime.py: extends the dimOS LeRobot policy runtime.
  - src/kiteos/data/dual_openyam.urdf: copy of the dimOS asset
    data/dual_openyam_abc_box_v2/dual_openyam.urdf (see below).

Third-party material distributed with KiteOS:

